description.text:
Benchmark Analytics builds software tools used by law enforcement agencies around the country. Their predictive analytics tools help to encourage positive police behavior and identify negative behaviors so they can be addressed before issues escalate.

As a DevOps Engineer, I manage cloud infrastructure that powers the Benchmark Analytics platform and SaaS products.

    ◉  Manage multi-account AWS Infrastructure

    ◉  Build and maintain scalable and highly available infrastructure used by Benchmark Analytics’ engineering team and applications;

    ◉  Support the growth of Benchmark Analytics’ infrastructure in the cloud while supporting limited on-premise deployments;

    ◉  Maintain top-level security practices and mechanisms for allowing only permitted access to protected system

    ◉  Improve safety of customer data at rest and in transit

    ◉  Help implement vulnerability management and penetration testing programs

    ◉  Implement and maintain CI/CD tools and frameworks for robust deployments

    ◉  Provide tooling and support for the Benchmark engineering team deployment processes;

    ◉ Design, implement, and maintain monitoring for all components of application, infrastructure, and deployment;

    ◉  Provide services to core monitoring/observability functionality and develop frameworks for engineers to interact with these services;

    ◉  Build monitoring/alerting systems and dashboards that inform engineering, product, and executives
